        "text_kyUgaB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Choose Custom Powder Coating?",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<ul><li><strong>Uniform Coatings: </strong>EZG’s in-house powder coat booths provide high-quality sprays that deliver a durable finish. Multiple painting modules and automatic powder nozzles efficiently handle large surface areas in a short amount of time. The powder coat finish is uniform and has properties that enhance corrosion resistance. </li><li><strong>Adhere to Any Finished Surface: </strong>Our protective coatings are safe to adhere to the finished surface of your choice, including sheet metal, stainless steel, and aluminum. </li><li><strong>Environmentally Friendly:</strong> Free from solvents and volatile organic compounds, powder coating materials do not transfer harmful chemicals to the environment during or following application. This is a significant advantage compared to liquid paint and liquid coating options. The dry powder application method eliminates runoff issues and reduces waste.</li></ul><p>These factors allow the finished product to fit the specific needs of a variety of industries and environments.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "center-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
            "desktop_column": "2",
            "desktop_row": "2",
