    "content_collage_WJRyJG": {
      "type": "content-collage",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yPzxHz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " Why Choose EZG for Your Powder Coating Needs?",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<ul><li><strong>Large Capacity Booths: </strong>Our large, 7′ × 7′ × 19′ capacity booth can accommodate most industrial equipment. From small precision components to large structural elements that fit within our spacious booth dimensions, we provide professional-grade powder coating that enhances both functionality and appearance for products across numerous industries.</li><li><strong>Expert Team: </strong>Our powder coating specialists bring years of industry experience and technical knowledge to every project. Each team member is thoroughly trained in the latest powder coating techniques and equipment operation, ensuring consistent, high-quality results. With attention to detail and dedication to excellence, our team carefully prepares each metal surface, selects appropriate industrial powder materials, and monitors the powder coating process from start to finish. This expertise allows us to tackle complex projects with confidence and deliver exceptional finishes that exceed industry standards and ensure customer satisfaction.</li><li><strong>Durable Sprays & Coatings: </strong>The final coat’s flexibility allows it to bend and transform easily with the material’s surface. This means it works well with materials that change with high temperature, like metal. Powder coats are more resistant to solvents, salts, and impact damage during transportation and operation. This custom coating lasts longer and remains vibrant for longer periods of time compared to more traditional methods of painting.</li></ul>",
            "desktop_content_position": "center-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
            "desktop_column": "2",
